e | but, cask, as a measure of wine | a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | a packing unit (measure?) of alum | but as an article of commerce, but meaning of cassis in this context is unknown | as a packing unit for liquid goods, not wine | as a packing unit (measure?) of thread | but, a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | but as a packing unit for dry goods, here of raisins | as a packing unit for liquid goods | a cask for wine (OED s.v. butt n.3 1a) (equivalent to 2 hogsheads or ½ tun) | but, a cask, as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | as a packing unit of currants"
